  LOOP AT GT_DATA ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<LFS_DATA>).
    IF I_MTART EQ 'X'.
      ASSIGN COMPONENT 'MTART' OF STRUCTURE <LFS_DATA> TO FIELD-SYMBOL(<LFW_KEY>).
      IF <LFW_KEY> IS ASSIGNED.
        READ TABLE LT_T134T INTO DATA(LS_T134T) WITH KEY MTART = <LFW_KEY> BINARY SEARCH.
        IF SY-SUBRC = 0.
          ASSIGN COMPONENT 'MTART_TEXT' OF STRUCTURE <LFS_DATA> TO FIELD-SYMBOL(<LFW_VALUE>).
          IF <LFW_VALUE> IS ASSIGNED.
            <LFW_VALUE> = LS_T134T-MTBEZ.
            UNASSIGN <LFW_VALUE>.
          ENDIF.
        ENDIF.
        UNASSIGN <LFW_KEY>.
      ENDIF.
    ENDIF.
*******************************************
