        IF SY-SUBRC = 0.
          ASSIGN COMPONENT 'MATKL_TEXT' OF STRUCTURE <LFS_DATA> TO <LFW_VALUE>.
          IF <LFW_VALUE> IS ASSIGNED.
            IF LS_T023T-WGBEZ60 IS NOT INITIAL.
              <LFW_VALUE> = LS_T023T-WGBEZ60.
            ELSE.
              <LFW_VALUE> = LS_T023T-WGBEZ.
